{%- comment -%}
  Alt text for an image: its own alt (Admin → Content → Files / product media) when set, otherwise the approved
  text from the QA sheet (Launch QA Flags, Fixes tab, A-01 / A-07), matched on the file name. Echoes the alt,
  unescaped (image_tag escapes it). Add a line "file-name-part => alt text" to cover a new image.
  Accepts: image {image}, scope {String} optional prefix for names that repeat across products (product handle),
           fallback {String} optional, used when nothing matches.
{%- endcomment -%}
